# .env.example — placeholder values ONLY (SEC-SECRETS-02).
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Each variable: NAME=            # where to get the value
#
# CounterKit needs no credentials. When an app grows around it, runtime secrets go to
# Keychain (STK-SWIFT-07) — .env is for build/tooling values only on this stack, e.g.:
# APP_STORE_CONNECT_KEY_ID=      # App Store Connect -> Users and Access -> Keys
